<title>SRI LANKA: John Keells in early volume trade.</title>
<headline>John Keells in early volume trade.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Keells Holdings Ltd saw early volume trading as 240,000 shares were traded at 192 rupees, brokers said.</p>
<p>The share last traded at 191.75 rupees.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors consider the share good value at current levels, because it rose to over 400 rupees when the market last rallied in early 1994,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>John Keells Holdings is the largest of three blue-chip conglomerates listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
